    "detailed_description": "Solve interesting puzzles, manipulate <strong>Shifting Blocks</strong> to your advantage, and be careful not to crush yourself!<br>The Shifting Dungeon has 40+ rooms to explore, all with an optional star to collect, totaling <strong>80+</strong> unique challenges.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/6f28c67dc085079ab39f68e7e87d09d1.poster.avif?t=1703029437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/6f28c67dc085079ab39f68e7e87d09d1.webm?t=1703029437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/6f28c67dc085079ab39f68e7e87d09d1.mp4?t=1703029437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>You take control of the robot character, He can strategically blow up nearby blocks by crushing himself, he will then safely rebuild himself again<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/c4b516341231ffca04b680ac75190bb8.poster.avif?t=1703029437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/c4b516341231ffca04b680ac75190bb8.webm?t=1703029437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/c4b516341231ffca04b680ac75190bb8.mp4?t=1703029437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Use blocks to avoid dangerous <strong>lazers</strong>!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/2e57359479429b132decba86921ac9a4.poster.avif?t=1703029437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/2e57359479429b132decba86921ac9a4.webm?t=1703029437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/2e57359479429b132decba86921ac9a4.mp4?t=1703029437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Break the <strong>Shifting Blocks</strong> into smaller parts!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/57ef3bb26e77b6a9dfdfc3de5c080e39.poster.avif?t=1703029437\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/57ef3bb26e77b6a9dfdfc3de5c080e39.webm?t=1703029437\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1757360/extras/57ef3bb26e77b6a9dfdfc3de5c080e39.mp4?t=1703029437\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
